# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in every checkout, whatever the
# platform's core.autocrlf: Godot, the ship generators and the gate scripts all
# write LF, so a CRLF checkout (Windows) showed every .import the engine touched as
# changed, and broke whatever reads a file line by line (test_sailor.gd's regex).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.glb binary
*.blend binary
*.blend1 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.fnt binary
